<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Carson says merger may add 50 pct to sales.</title>
<headline>Carson says merger may add 50 pct to sales.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haircare an beauty products concern Carson Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that Black Like Me, with which it is discussing a merger, could contribute approximately half the sales of the merged company.</p>
<p>The announcement follows an earlier statement by Carson's U.S. parent Carson Inc issued in the United States that the merger could double the size of the South African company.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
